<title>USA: ABT Building says reaches labor agreement.</title>
<headline>ABT Building says reaches labor agreement.</headline>
<dateline>NEENAH, Wis. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABT Building Products Corp said it reached an agreement with the International Association of Machinists representing hourly manufacturing employees at its Alpena, Michigan facility.</p>
<p>The new agreement is in effect from September 1 through December 15, 2000, said the company.</p>
<p>ABT also said construction of a new fiber-cement plant at its facility in Roaring River, N.C. is expected to be completed on time and within the $55 million budget.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
